{v:'VER',what:'his order 2026-10-12, the lock-on beeping is annoying and inconsistent when machines get together, make it a low siren: with 1, 3 and 6 machines on him there is one siren voice that wails (pitch inside 200 to 400 Hz, period inside 1.2 to 1.6 s), a little louder and no slower with more, toward the nearest, on the machine bus; nothing plays with none on him, under the pause box or under G.sim; no machine beeps on its own; the seeded stream does not move',
 run:function(){
